Significance: minor
Type: added

Expose upcoming events and RSVP counts through the WordPress Abilities API, so REST clients, WP-CLI, and AI tooling can read a site's schedule without hard-coding GatherPress post types, meta keys, or RSVP comment storage. Both abilities are read-only. The upcoming events listing is public, matching the event archive it mirrors, and the RSVP counts follow the same access rule as the roster, for any post type that supports RSVPs.
